== Rencana uninstall PXE dashboard ==
  Dihentikan + dihapus:
    dir          /srv/pxe/tftp
    dir          /srv/pxe/boot
    tree         /opt/pxe-dashboard
    file         /srv/pxe/tftp/snponly.efi
    file         /srv/pxe/tftp/undionly.kpxe
    file         /etc/dnsmasq.d/pxe-dashboard.conf
    dir          /etc/systemd/system/dnsmasq.service.d
    file         /etc/systemd/system/dnsmasq.service.d/pxe-dashboard.conf
    file         /etc/nginx/sites-available/pxe-dashboard
    link         /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/pxe-dashboard
    restore-link /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/default
    file         /etc/pxe-dashboard.env
    file         /etc/systemd/system/pxe-dashboard.service
    dir          /etc/exports.d
    file         /etc/exports.d/pxe-dashboard.exports
    file         /etc/nfs.conf.d/pxe-dashboard.conf
    file         /etc/logrotate.d/pxe-dashboard
    file         /etc/netplan/99-pxe-dashboard.yaml
    fstab        /srv/pxe/media/ubuntu-24.04
    mount        /srv/pxe/media/ubuntu-24.04
    unit         pxe-dashboard.service
  Data DIPERTAHANKAN (pakai --purge untuk menghapus):
    user         pxe
    data         /var/lib/pxe-dashboard
    data         /var/log/dnsmasq-pxe.log
    data         /srv/pxe
    data         /srv/pxe/media
    data         /srv/pxe/media/ubuntu-24.04
    data         /srv/pxe/media/debian-12
    data         /srv/pxe/media/rocky-9
    data         /srv/pxe/media/debian-netboot
